/**
 * Static labels and destinations shared by UI and search. Standard controls require a definition;
 * every definition is indexed automatically, without composing or opening settings pages.
 * Only resources and literal aliases belong here, never preference values, accounts or vault data.
 * Nested/protected settings locate their existing parent entrance, preserving authentication.
 */
